    "chunk_text": "In the retail market top seven companies that have mainly contributed to the turnover were\u00a0 E B Creasy Rs 150 million (3.8 million shares traded), Sampath Bank Rs 96 million (703,000 shares traded), Haycarb Rs 74 million (420,000 shares traded), Commercial Bank Rs 46 million (1.4 million shares traded), Access Engineering Rs 37 million (461,000 shares traded) and JKH Rs 36 million (1.8 million shares traded). During the day 43 million shares volumes changed hands in 13502 transactions. It was said that manufacturing sector counters especially EB Creasy and JKH performed well. Further banking sector counters especially Sampath Bank Commercial Bank also performed well.\n\nThe telegraphic transfer rate for the dollar was Rs 331.80 buying, Rs 340.80 selling; the euro was Rs\u00a0 377.8715 buying, Rs\u00a0391.7885 selling; and the pound was Rs 447.7701 buying, 461.8157 selling.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
