    "description": "From ICU to Stock Exchange: Why an AI-tech bubble could decide Sri Lanka\u2019s next crisis",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/From-ICU-to-Stock-Exchange-Why-an-AI-tech-bubble-could-decide-Sri-Lanka-s-next-crisis/4-794766",
